    <innerclass refid="classwhelmed_1_1_mermaid_block" prot="public">whelmed::MermaidBlock</innerclass>
    <innernamespace refid="namespacewhelmed">whelmed</innernamespace>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Renders a mermaid diagram from SVG parse result. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Takes a pre-parsed MermaidParseResult and renders primitives scaled to fit the available width. ViewBox determines aspect ratio.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>MESSAGE THREAD. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>MermaidSVGParser </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
